# ==============================
# DO NOT IGNORE
# ==============================
# These are part of the repository and should be committed:
#
# data/
# resources/
# docs/
# scripts/
# public/
# .agents/
# .github/
# skills-lock.json
#
# .github/ must remain tracked because GitHub Actions
# workflows will live there.
#
# .agents/ must remain tracked if it contains project
# agent configuration.